# ====================================================================
# DataGalactic LeadPilot AI — Environment Configuration (.env)
# ====================================================================

# 1. Server Configuration
PORT=5005

# ====================================================================
# 2. REAL-TIME EMAIL OTP VERIFICATION (Nodemailer / SMTP)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real email-ku 6-digit OTP code poganum na, keela irukara 2 options-la
# ethavathu onnu fill pannunga:
# ====================================================================

# --- OPTION A: Free Gmail App Password (Romba Easy & 100% Free) ---
# 1. Unga Google Account Settings -> Security -> 2-Step Verification ON pannunga
# 2. "App passwords" search panni "LeadPilot AI" create pannunga (16-char code kedaikum)
# 3. Atha keela paste pannunga:
GMAIL_USER=kan93095@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASS=unsi cbcf imbk miid

# --- OPTION B: Custom Domain SMTP (Titan, Zoho, Brevo, SendGrid, Hostinger) ---
# Unga official domain email (e.g. contact@datagalactic.com) iruntha ithu use pannalam:
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=

# Email Sender Name & Address
EMAIL_FROM="LeadPilot AI <no-reply@datagalactic.com>"

# ====================================================================
# 3. EXTERNAL AI & LEAD SOURCING APIS (Optional)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ithu empty-ah irunthalum zero-cost demo/mock leads & AI template work aagum.
# Real live data venumna free API keys podalam:
